	)
	(text "R: +3V3 -> Q1 -> N_DUT -> DUT -> B -> K2A -> R mux -> RSENSE -> GND. OPAMP1: VINP=B(PA7), VINM=VREF(PA3), VOUT=PA2. TIA: LMC6482 A."
